cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use medlint in research, please cite the software using this metadata.
title: medlint
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: Yuruk
    given-names: Mehmet Aytug
repository-code: https://github.com/mehmetaytugyuruk/medlint
url: https://github.com/mehmetaytugyuruk/medlint
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - dataset auditing
  - DICOM
  - medical imaging
  - machine learning
  - split integrity
abstract: >-
  medlint is a lightweight, evidence-first, offline split-integrity auditor for
  medical imaging datasets. It reports potential contamination risks and audit
  coverage before model training without claiming patient identification or
  leakage-free certification.
